 | Option | Commands | Meaning |
 |---|---|---|
-| `--every month\|year` | add | How often the plan charges you (default `month`). |
-| `--since YYYY-MM-DD` | add | Date of the first charge (default today). Later charges fall on the same day of the month, or the last day of a shorter month. |
+| `--every month\|year\|week` | add | How often the plan charges you (default `month`). |
+| `--since YYYY-MM-DD` | add | Date of the first charge (default today). Monthly/yearly charges fall on the same day of the month or the last day of a shorter month. Weekly charges fall every 7 days. |
 | `--within <days>` | renewals | How far ahead to look (default 30). A charge today counts. |
 | `--today YYYY-MM-DD` | list, renewals, export | Pretend today is another date. |
 | `--file <path>` | all | Where your subscriptions are kept. Default: `$SUBTRACK_FILE`, else `./subscriptions.json`. |
 
 ## Money
 
-Prices are typed in euros (`12.99`, `1,299.00`) and kept in whole cents. The monthly cost of a yearly plan is its
-price divided by 12.
+Prices are typed in euros (`12.99`, `1,299.00`) and kept in whole cents.
+
+- **Monthly plans**: Monthly cost is the price.
+- **Yearly plans**: Monthly cost is the price divided by 12.
+- **Weekly plans**: Monthly cost is the price times 52 (weeks per year) divided by 12 (months per year), rounded to the nearest cent. For example, €12 a week costs €52.00 a month.
 
